 The question asks they will both be not white. Considering that these are draws without replacement there are following possibilities :
draw 1, draw 2
===== =====
1) Not white, white;
2) white, Not white;
3) white, white;
4) Not white, not white;
The answer has to be either P(4) OR all exclusion of the 3 previous conditions i.e. 1- [P(1) + P(2) + P(3)] => neither of the draws are white
P(4) = 6/8*5/7=15/28
1- [P(1) + P(2) + P(3)] = 1 - [ (6/8 * 2/7) + (2/8*6/7) + (2/8*1/7)] = 1 - [26/8*7] = 1 - [13/28] = 15/28
A
The answer is 15/28

